{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Air Cargo ULD Lookup"},"description":"Air-cargo ULD (unit load device) specifications \u2014 16 types: lower-deck containers (AKE/LD3 and family), main-deck pallets (PMC, PAG and family) and temperature-controlled units. type as an IATA code (\"AKE\"), slug (\"ake-ld3\") or the record's own name (\"LD3\" \u2192 AKE) gives one record; omit it to list all 16; category and deck filter. Pallet records have no internal dimensions \u2014 read max_build_up_height_cm, and do not multiply dimensions for a volume. For the sea-freight equivalent use container_lookup; for what the cargo inside is billed at chargeable_weight_calculator; for whose aircraft it flies on airline_lookup. Rate-limited: a limit error carries reset_at, the UTC time the allowance resets. Provenance is pending, not verified (treat tare_weight with particular caution); confirm operationally critical dimensions with the carrier.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"category":{"description":"Filter by ULD category.","enum":["container","pallet","special"],"type":"string"},"deck":{"description":"Filter by deck position.","enum":["lower","main"],"type":"string"},"full":{"description":"Lists only: true returns full records instead of summary rows.","type":"boolean"},"limit":{"description":"Lists only: rows per page.","maximum":100,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"offset":{"description":"Lists only: rows to skip (default 0).","maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"type":{"description":"IATA ULD code (\"AKE\") or slug. Omit to list all.","minLength":2,"type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"name":"uld_lookup","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":true,"properties":{"_source":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"autho